 "stimulus_html": "Given the statements:\n<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\text~p\">\\text~p</span>: Some apples are not sweet.\n<br>\n<span data-math=\"r\">r</span>: No triangles are squares.<br>\n<span data-math=\"s\">s</span>: Some vegetables are green.\nWrite each of the following symbolic statements in words.",
 "questions": [
