     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>You negate a “Some…not” statement by replacing “Some…not” with “All.”</p>\n<p>Original statement: Some apples are not sweet.</p>\n<p>Negation: All apples are sweet.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "All apples are sweet.\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
