     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>You negate a “No” statement by replacing “No” with “Some.”</p>\n<p>Original statement: No triangles are squares.</p>\n<p>Negation: Some triangles are squares.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Some triangles are squares."
    }
   ],
